      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On the 2018 Open Beta (Currently build 878) this is partially resolved. While the initial broadcasts seem to work, there are times when later broadcasts from the same group of objects require you to be near or looking at it. Using the same world, grabbing the remote and clicking some of the buttons may not always send/receive if the remote isn't near you. I did not get the logs for this so I'm not sure on what happened exactly.\n\nRelated canny\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/878-spawning-a-complicated-object-causes-the-client-to-freeze",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
